<title>USA: Bedford Property makes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Bedford Property makes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bedford Property Investors Inc said it had bought or would buy a total of five properties.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Thursday it bought three properties in Seattle and Fremont and Concord, Calif. It also has pending acquisitions in San Diego and Napa, Calif.</p>
<p>&quot;The aggregate value of the five acquisitions is in excess of $27 million, and and is projected to produce an initial yield in excess of 10.5 percent,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;This would bring Bedford's 1996 acquisitions to 10 properties having an aggregate value in excess of $60 million.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
